{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "b878b3b0-9bb5-825e-b08c-7051ea6ae03b",
  "created_at": "2026-02-10T11:05:31-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, City Clerk",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Beatriz Valdez",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Owen Haskell",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:03:20-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "City Clerk's office, this is Owen. How can I help you?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:03:24-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Good morning, Mr. Owen. Thank you for taking my call. My name is Beatriz Valdez. I would like to ask about old records, please. Genealogy records."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:03:33-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Sure, I can help with that. What kind of records are you looking for? Birth, marriage, death?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:03:39-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, a marriage record and also a birth record. They are from the 1930s, from Newport. They are for my husband's family."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:03:47-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. So, the 1930s. Those are older records, and we can usually search them. Do you know the names and roughly what year?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:03:55-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I have the names, yes. The year of the marriage I think is 1934, but I am not completely sure. It could be 1935."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:04:03-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's fine. A year or two either way is workable. We'd search a range. You'd want to fill out a request form with the names and the dates you have."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:04:13-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay. Can I ask, please, how long does it take? The turnaround time. When I send the request, how many days until I receive it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:04:22-05:00",
      "duration": 17,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Um, it depends on how busy we are and how much searching there is. If the dates are close, it's usually quicker. I'd say plan on a couple of weeks, maybe a bit more. If you want, I can check with the records person and call you back with a better idea."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:04:39-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, that would be very kind. My number is 401-555-0163."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:04:43-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Zero one six three. Four oh one, five five five, zero one six three. Got it. And is it Valdez, V-A-L-D-E-Z?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:04:51-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yes, correct. Valdez. Excuse me one moment. [pause] Sorry. My eldest son is in the other room, he is the technology support of the family. He is fixing the router, so the internet is going on and off."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:05:04-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No problem. Do you have email or would you rather get the form by mail?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:05:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "By mail is better for now, until the router is fixed. I will give you my address."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:05:16-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Go ahead whenever you're ready. Actually, I can also have it ready at the counter if you'd rather pick it up."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:05:24-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mail, please. I will give it to you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-10T11:05:28-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Okay, go ahead, I'm writing it down."
    }
  ],
